      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1284 - It is narrated from Muhammad ibn Isma'il ibn Bazi' from Imam al-Ridha (as) that He said:\nI asked him about the prayer in Mecca and Medina, whether it should be shortened or completed.\nImam (as) said: \"Shorten it unless you intend to stay for ten days”."
